# A competency question with NO linked test yet — it records a requirement the
# ontology should answer, before any mustrd test demonstrates it. This file has
# no must:TestSpec at all; the CQ is still discovered and reported as a gap
# (Test column "—") to show that CQs are first-class and can precede their test.
@prefix must: <https://mustrd.org/model/> .
@prefix :     <http://example.org/place/example/> .

:populationOfRotterdamCQ
    a must:CompetencyQuestion ;
    must:question "What is the population of Rotterdam?" .
